<http://data.silknow.org/object/2ca71ce9-0773-38dc-bc9b-8afaab72a9d6/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Scarf made of red silk crepe with pattern woven in an irregular satin of four. At each end of the scarf is a panel with its own border pattern containing three large curving flower sprays. The rest of the scarf is covered with staggered rows of a small floral sprig, with side borders of a floral meander.\n\nThe two ends have a knotted fringe of red silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/2ca71ce9-0773-38dc-bc9b-8afaab72a9d6> .

